{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>SandBlocks</strong></i>\u00a0will later on be a physics simulator/tech demo/Sandbox game that lets you play around with props and items I make that will also appear in future games I make. As of now, it's currently in alpha stages so it might have features not done implementing or bugs, it only has small game play features like walking/running, jumping and crouching, but later on I will add more to the game like possibly, wall running, climbing, etc. This game will\u00a0also later on be made into a game engine,<i><strong>\u00a0</strong></i>and later on will allow you to make your own custom add-ons/maps/game modes to upload to the steam workshop. This game is currently in it's alpha stages right now so there will be bugs and a lack of features for the time being. But it will get updates when ever possible and devlogs at my YouTube channel:\u00a0.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I hope you have fun still!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>(Disclaimer: Exception to code, nothing in my game or in any future games I make, has and never will have AI generated slop of textures, models, branding, descriptions, etc.)</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"I Love SandBlocks","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3963720/d756b125a8865d5ed44b626d10c605c0e76b9bf3.jpg"},{"name":"OOOOOOOHHHHHHH MY PCCCCCCCCCC!!!!!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3963720/6aacdafb6ce25ab00caf84e96d3e1eebd46d4161.jpg"},{"name":"UUUUUAAAGGGGHHHHHHH","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3963720/3f5dde35993283133540475b058435e96727ce96.jpg"},{"name":"FAST! FAST! FAST!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3963720/cfb3b8cf96219b1160b23249519650b23a17a5b8.jpg"},{"name":"You should do that","path":"https://cdn